# Datasets
# Bulk artifacts (background images, 22k generated samples) stay out of git —
# they live on HuggingFace. The small colour tables are the actual output of
# the taxonomy + Voronoi-resampling stages and MUST be tracked: without them
# the pipeline cannot be run from step 1.
#
# NOTE: `datasets/*` (not `datasets/`) is deliberate. Git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded, so excluding the directory itself
# would make the `!` rules below silently dead.
data/
datasets/*
*.npy
*.npz
*.csv
!datasets/*.csv

